## Screenshot overlay: bottom hints and status messages.

overlay-hint-idle = Drag to select · Double-click/Enter to copy · Ctrl+S to save · C copies the color · Esc/right-click to cancel

overlay-hint-tool = Drag inside the selection to draw · Ctrl+Z undo · Ctrl+Y redo · Enter to copy · Ctrl+S to save · Esc to cancel

overlay-hint-text = Type text · Enter to finish · Shift+Enter for a new line · Esc to discard

overlay-hint-record = Drag to select the recording area · Double-click/Enter to start · Esc/right-click to cancel

overlay-hint-scroll = Drag to select the area to scroll-capture · Double-click/Enter to start · Esc/right-click to cancel

overlay-msg-annotation-unavailable = Annotation is unavailable.

overlay-msg-select-area-first = Select an area first.

overlay-msg-selection-invalid = The selection is not valid.

overlay-msg-select-scroll-first = Select the area to scroll-capture first.

overlay-msg-scroll-single-display = The scrolling-capture area cannot span displays.

overlay-msg-select-record-first = Select the recording area first.

overlay-msg-record-single-display = The recording area cannot span displays.

